    "Id": "chassisdef_blood_reaper_BRR-3",
    "Name": "Blood Reaper",
    "Details": "Forming the foundation of the new Zosma factory, the Blood Reaper 3 was upgraded with advanced targeting systems for all weapons while the ATMs were swapped for SRMs and coolant pods\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
